MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_001: Now then...die.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_002: Mother... Yu Phas... May you both help this\none's soul find its way to peace.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_003: <NCA>"You pray for those you defeat?"
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_004: Killing is followed by praying, yes. And while\nclasping my necklace in reverence.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_005: <NCA>"That necklace is beautiful."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_006: <NCB>"Is that necklace important?"
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_007: <ACA>I, too, find it beautiful, Promised One—beautiful\nand cherished.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_008: <ACB>It is important, Promised One, and quite\nsignificant to me.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_009: The necklace was my mother's—part of the\nvestment of a lead priest in Yu Phas's temple.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_010: You can see the mark of Yu Phas engraved\non it—the Diadem of the Apostle.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_011: I was told repeatedly to take it off, and\nrepeatedly I refused to comply.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_012: Yu Phas is benevolence itself, after all, in her\nwork as the goddess of death.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_013: Then you understand, Promised One. That fills\nmy heart with joy.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_014: I must confess, as I speak with you now, it's as\nif I feel Yu Phas's presence with us.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_015: You, too, are kindness personified—a caring ear,\nright here. You calm the spirits around us.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_016: <NCA>"You're kind too, praying as you did."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_017: Praying is the most vital part of it.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_018: But in Balor's world, the souls of those killed don't\nenter the natural cycle. They're trapped.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_019: Death is meant to be a step into the next world.\nSad, of course, yes. But feared? No.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_020: So I've always thought, killing as I do. But in this\nworld, where entrapment and torment is next...
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_021: Ah... I fear, Promised One, that what I'm doing now\nis heaping sins upon sins.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_022: <NCA>"But we must keep up the fight."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_023: Keep up the fight... That sounds so easy, so\nsimple, so now but not later...
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_024: <NCA>"You and I will defeat Balor."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_025: Of course. We defeat Balor. We open the way\nto the Garden of Nibbana. Yes?
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_026: All those pitiable, pitiable souls—they won't suffer\nfor one more moment.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_027: Then you can depend on me to dispatch those\nwho must be dispatched.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_A_028: Souls are at stake. I'll see this through to the\nvery end.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_001: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_002: <NCA>"Ninae?"
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_003: I knew you were alive. The spirits told me so.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_004: I'm pleased to lay eyes on your face again,\nPromised One. Welcome back.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_005: <NCA>"It's nice to be back, Ninae."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_006: It is nice, isn't it? And it's nice...to be alive\nat all.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_007: I've lived a life of mourning—longing to ease the\nanguish of separation, if only for a day.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_008: So, meeting again, like this? What joy! One\nreserved only for the living, it seems.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_009: But, I have been thinking, if the spirits were right,\nand you weren't dead...
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_010: that maybe you wouldn't come back anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_011: After all, you appeared so suddenly in Dagda, as\nif summoned only for your mission.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_012: Now that we've defeated Balor, I thought you'd just\ngo elsewhere—somewhere unknown even to me.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_013: Not to the underworld. Nor the Garden of Nibbana.\nOr to our progenitor god. Somewhere...else.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_014: <NCA>"Rest assured. I'm right here."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_015: <NCB>"Your thoughts are running away with you."
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_016: <ACA>Still, I find myself worried, even scared.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_017: <ACB>Are they? Running away with me? Well then, tell\nme—why do I feel so consumed by worry?
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_018: I fear that—more likely—you are not here at all.\nA trick of the spirits. An illusion. A delusion.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_019: <NCA>"What can I do to ease your disbelief?"
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_020: It's simple...I suppose.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_021: <RSDS>Warmth... Real warmth. Living and alive,\nright here with me.
MID_SE_Ism_Nin_S_022: Don't go elsewhere ever again. I hope to stay at\nyour side, protecting you forever and always.